l kills the same three tests, because the surest way to lose a boundary is to have it quietly weakened during an unrelated repair.\n\nGates from a clean detached checkout at the exact head: gofmt, go build ./..., go vet ./..., git diff --check, go test ./... -count=1, go test ./spike/querysandbox -count=10, and go test -race ./spike/querysandbox -count=1. I will record architecture, security and simplification conclusions and file one verdict with gs review. I will not edit and will not merge."}